nt against Schultz, signaling that he is well-positioned to outperform his raw base projection. We are maintaining a disciplined approach to our game caps by keeping **Miguel Vargas** and **Brayan Rocchio** on the bench, as their current daily efficiency scores fail to eclipse the threshold set by our active starters.",
